---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Service — HevaSEO"
  description="HevaSEO's terms of service: the rules for using our entity backlink, SEO/GEO content, and indexer services."
>

<main class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-5 py-14 lg:px-8 lg:py-20">
    <p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-primary">Legal</p>
    <h1 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight md:text-4xl">Terms of Service</h1>
    <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground">Last updated: June 7, 2026</p>

    <div class="prose-heva mt-10 space-y-8 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-foreground">1. Acceptance of terms</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">By using the hevaseo.com website and HevaSEO's services, you agree to the terms below. If you do not agree, please stop using the services.</p>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-foreground">2. Services provided</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">HevaSEO provides SEO/GEO services including entity backlinks, SEO content writing, and a backlink indexer, along with supporting services (audit, website optimization, keyword research, web design). The specific scope is described in each project's quote/contract.</p>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-foreground">3. Quotes &amp; payment</h2>
        <ul class="mt-2 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-5">
          <li>Prices shown on the website are for reference; the final quote depends on your industry, competition, and scope of work.</li>
          <li>Payment terms, milestones, and acceptance are agreed upon in each service contract.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-foreground">4. Results commitment</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">We work using white-hat methods, compliant with Google's policies. SEO is affected by many factors beyond our control (algorithms, competition, the current state of your website), so the time frame and degree of ranking improvement are estimates, not absolute guarantees, unless explicitly stated in writing in the contract.</p>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-foreground">5. Customer responsibilities</h2>
        <ul class="mt-2 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-5">
          <li>Provide the access and information needed to deliver the service.</li>
          <li>Ensure that content and products/services comply with applicable law.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-foreground">6. Intellectual property</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">Content, source code, and materials created by HevaSEO are licensed to the customer once payment is completed per the contract, except for HevaSEO's internal tools and processes.</p>
      </section>
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-foreground">7. Contact</h2>
        <p class="mt-2">For any questions about these terms of service, please contact us by email at <a class="font-medium text-primary hover:underline" href="mailto:hello@hevaseo.com">hello@hevaseo.com</a> or by phone at +1 (415) 555-0142.</p>
      </section>
      <p class="rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-4 text-xs">Note: This is a reference template. Please review it with your legal team before publishing.</p>
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
